{"id":"word:hebrew:H3104","type":"word","title":"יוֹבֵל","subtitle":"H3104 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"the blast of a horn (from its continuous sound); specifically, the signal of the silver trumpets; hence, the instrument itself and the festival thus introduced","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יוֹבֵל (H3104) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 27 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יוֹבֵל (yôwbêl) means the blast of a horn (from its continuous sound); specifically, the signal of the silver trumpets; hence, the instrument itself and the festival thus introduced First listed occurrence: Exod 19 13."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יוֹבֵל","transliteration":"yôwbêl","pronunciation":"yo-bale'","strong":"H3104","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3104","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["הַ/יֹּבֵ֖ל","הַ/יֹּבֵ֑ל","הַ/יֹּבֵ֔ל","הַ/יּֽוֹבְלִים֙","יוֹבֵ֣ל"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmsa",15],["HRd/Ncmsa",4],["HTd/Ncmpa",3],["HNcmsa",3],["HNcmpa",1],["HC/Rd/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"the blast of a horn (from its continuous sound); specifically, the signal of the silver trumpets; hence, the instrument itself and the festival thus introduced","usage":"jubile, ram's horn, trumpet.","full":"H3104. yobel יֹבֵל יוֺבֵל, noun masculine Num 36:4 ram, ram's horn, cornet (Phoenician יבל ram ; compare Di Lev 25:10 Dl Pr 124 ) — absolute יוֺבֵל Josh 6:5 7 t.; יֹבֵל Exod 19:13 13 t.; plural יוֺבְלִים Josh 6:4 2 t.; יֹבְלִים 6:13 ; &#8212; 1 ram , only in combination: הַיּ בְּקֶרֶן ׳בִּמְשֹׁךְ Josh 6:5 the ram's horn , as wind-instrument; so שׁוֺפְרוֺת(ה)י(ו)בלים 6:4 , 6 , 8 , 13 rams' horns (see Benz Archäol. 276 ); יֹבֵל alone, הַיֹּבֵל בִּמְשֹׁךְ Exod 19:13 at the sounding of the ram ('s horn). 2 designation of 50th year , marked by blowing of cornets, AV 'jubile' (so Late Hebrew יובֵילָא ᵑ7 יוֺבֵל, , as loan-word); originally no doubt הַיּוֺבֵל שְׁנַת year of the ram ('s horn), as Lev 25:13 , 28 , 40 , 50 , 52 , 54 (all H), 27:17-18 , 23 , 24 (all P), but then, without שׁנת , as לָכֶם תִּהְיֶה הִוא יוֺבֵל 25:10 a ram ('s horn blowing) shall it be to you ; so 25:11 ; 25:12 ; 25:15 ; 25:28 ; 25:30 ; 25:31 ; 25:33 (all H), 27:18 ; Num 36:4 (both P).","rootNote":"or יֹבֵל ; apparently from 2986 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Exod 19 13","keyReferences":["Exod 19 13","Josh 6 4","Josh 6 5","Josh 6 6","Josh 6 8","Josh 6 13","Lev 25 10","Lev 25 11"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":27,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Exod 19 13","book":"Exod","chapter":19,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יֹּבֵ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Josh 6 4","book":"Josh","chapter":6,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יּֽוֹבְלִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Josh 6 5","book":"Josh","chapter":6,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יּוֹבֵ֗ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Josh 6 6","book":"Josh","chapter":6,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יוֹבְלִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"Josh 6 8","book":"Josh","chapter":6,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יּֽוֹבְלִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Josh 6 13","book":"Josh","chapter":6,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יֹּבְלִ֗ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Lev 25 10","book":"Lev","chapter":25,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יוֹבֵ֥ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Lev 25 11","book":"Lev","chapter":25,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יוֹבֵ֣ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Lev 25 12","book":"Lev","chapter":25,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יוֹבֵ֣ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Lev 25 13","book":"Lev","c